Homepage: https://github.com/M-Wham/sockswebui
Description: SOCKS5 proxy slots with WireGuard routes
 sockswebui is a single static program with a web UI. It manages up to four
 SOCKS5 proxy slots. Each slot sends traffic through a route of WireGuard
 tunnels and optional upstream SOCKS5 or HTTP proxies. The kill switch of each
 slot blocks traffic by default when the route fails.
